Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.76,0:00:15.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大胸…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.22,0:00:17.97,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,地震？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.39,0:00:26.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,最近常发生呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.96,0:00:48.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（29岁单身中坚冒险者的日常）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.49,0:01:59.32,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（第8话 村子的一员）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.41,0:02:00.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,多亏了莉露\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.78,0:02:03.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天史莱姆也是大丰收！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.79,0:02:05.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.29,0:02:07.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,老奶奶\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.00,0:02:10.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 阿始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.88,0:02:12.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,工作刚结束吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.54,0:02:13.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.55,0:02:16.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,多亏你们认真工作\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.05,0:02:19.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,村子才能这么和平 真是帮了大忙了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.43,0:02:20.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们哦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.30,0:02:21.72,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,给\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.85,0:02:26.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,哇！是糖诶！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.31,0:02:28.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,从今往后\n也拜托你们守护这个村子哦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.02,0:02:29.39,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好嘞\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.94,0:02:32.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.32,0:02:43.99,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你就是驻村的冒险者吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.08,0:02:44.99,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,先下手为强！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.33,0:02:54.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 好痛…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.34,0:02:56.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,突然之间干什么啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.84,0:03:00.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.80,0:03:02.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这也太不讲理了吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.59,0:03:05.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是敌人\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.60,0:03:07.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是村子的自卫团成员！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.43,0:03:09.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,自卫团？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.77,0:03:12.27,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天我们来就是想说 那个\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.35,0:03:15.02,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你或许是有两下子\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.65,0:03:16.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但在这个村子里…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.28,0:03:21.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可不要太嚣张了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.65,0:03:22.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,什么？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.49,0:03:25.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,总之 守护这个村子是我们\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.99,0:03:28.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,自卫团的工作！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.12,0:03:31.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（自卫团小喽啰）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.37,0:03:33.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始先生 莉露！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.38,0:03:35.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎回来\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.50,0:03:37.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,娜塔莉酱\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.63,0:03:38.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我们回来了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.38,0:03:43.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,让君 好久不见！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.13,0:03:45.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.14,0:03:46.60,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你过得好吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.81,0:03:48.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.64,0:03:54.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你喜欢娜塔莉酱吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.65,0:03:57.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你小子说什么！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.15,0:04:02.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我前段时间也刚刚\n为喜不喜欢她而烦恼过呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.32,0:04:04.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你才故意来挑衅\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.24,0:04:06.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,住在她家旅馆的我啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.32,0:04:08.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我懂我懂\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.79,0:04:10.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,爱情这种东西太难了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.71,0:04:12.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那么\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.41,0:04:14.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,娜塔莉酱是怎么想的？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.54,0:04:16.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,诶？这个嘛…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.46,0:04:19.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,让君\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.92,0:04:22.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,只是我的好朋友\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.17,0:04:25.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,哈哈！被甩了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.68,0:04:29.89,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,老子宰了你\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.97,0:04:31.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,很危险的 混蛋！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.93,0:04:35.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你是村子的一员什么的…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.81,0:04:38.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我还没承认呢！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.44,0:04:39.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋 让\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.86,0:04:41.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,差不多得了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.44,0:04:42.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 回去吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.03,0:04:44.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你又打不过\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.61,0:04:46.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,去死 笨蛋！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.45,0:04:47.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那个…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.91,0:04:50.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟让君发生什么了吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.24,0:04:53.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不 他说守护村子是他的工作\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.58,0:04:57.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟他是自卫团的成员嘛\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.08,0:05:00.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,因为让君非常喜欢这个村子\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.01,0:05:04.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,刚甩了他还笑得这么开心\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.22,0:05:09.14,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.22,0:05:13.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不承认你是村子的一员是什么意思？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.39,0:05:16.39,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始原来不是这个村子的人吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.48,0:05:18.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我是这个村子的人\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.48,0:05:21.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是村子的常驻冒险者吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.36,0:05:27.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可那家伙说了不承认呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.11,0:05:29.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那是因为我来这个村子还没多久\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.28,0:05:32.49,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那是在捡到你之前不久的事情\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.83,0:05:34.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,原来是这样啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.50,0:05:35.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.50,0:05:37.67,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但是娜塔莉酱\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.75,0:05:39.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,旅馆的大叔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.50,0:05:41.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,还有奥莉芙姐姐都很温柔呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.00,0:05:42.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.55,0:05:47.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,他们因为工作性质\n本来就常和外面的人打交道\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.38,0:05:49.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,所以他们很快就接受了我\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.51,0:05:53.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不过 我要真正成为村子的一员\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.35,0:05:54.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,还需要很长时间吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.02,0:05:59.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那像傍晚那样挑衅的行为\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.98,0:06:02.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你还是不要做比较好\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.94,0:06:06.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦 去吃晚饭吧 莉露\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.28,0:06:09.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,把话题岔开了…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.42,0:06:20.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 又来了吗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.55,0:06:34.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,危险程度接近灾害级的魔兽\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.35,0:06:36.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,棘背龙\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.60,0:06:38.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,在国见山被目击到了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.81,0:06:40.60,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,棘背龙？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.98,0:06:42.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,国见山\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.61,0:06:44.32,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,离这里不就只隔着两座山吗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.52,0:06:47.24,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么那种魔兽会出现在村子附近\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.32,0:06:50.82,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,估计是在正在休息的迁徙鲸的背上\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.03,0:06:53.24,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,被运到这里来的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.32,0:06:55.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,棘背龙\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.20,0:06:58.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,栖息在克希地区的凶暴的魔兽\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.46,0:07:01.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,全身覆盖着坚硬的棘刺\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.58,0:07:02.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大概是在国见山\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.88,0:07:06.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,和那里的魔兽争夺地盘吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.09,0:07:08.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,最近频繁发生的地震\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.51,0:07:10.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,会不会就是它导致的？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.34,0:07:14.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要讨伐接近灾害级的魔兽\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.26,0:07:17.27,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大概需要多少人呢？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.35,0:07:19.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这个任务需要数个银级冒险者\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.73,0:07:21.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,组成小队才能应对\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.85,0:07:23.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,银级…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.98,0:07:25.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,组成小队…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.61,0:07:28.82,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.49,0:07:33.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你是比银级更强的\n白银级冒险者对吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.82,0:07:35.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你能讨伐棘背龙吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.37,0:07:39.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我没和那家伙战斗过\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.54,0:07:42.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要一个人去做\n好几名银级冒险者才能完成的任务\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.42,0:07:44.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是有点吓人啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.54,0:07:46.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,什么啊 真没出息\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.17,0:07:48.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,白银级冒险者\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.88,0:07:50.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,也没什么了不起的嘛\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.88,0:07:54.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你小子插什么嘴\n没看见大人们在商量正事吗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.39,0:07:59.97,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,老爹！不 我 我是自卫团…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.06,0:08:01.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不就是个小喽啰嘛\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.94,0:08:04.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,想在村子的会议上插嘴\n你还早了一百年呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.36,0:08:06.82,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,滚出去\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.15,0:08:13.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,什 什么嘛！可恶\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.66,0:08:16.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我要是认真干的话也能做到的啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.78,0:08:20.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的…\n我家那个傻儿子给你添麻烦了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.33,0:08:22.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,请继续吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.71,0:08:28.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,棘背龙非常危险\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.29,0:08:29.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,正如奥莉芙女士所说\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.88,0:08:33.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要讨伐它还是多人组队应对比较明智\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.59,0:08:36.34,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,幸运的是 现在在拉纳中心街\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.59,0:08:38.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,有曾经讨伐过棘背龙的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.85,0:08:40.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,银级冒险者\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.89,0:08:41.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,预算呢？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.31,0:08:45.31,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,因为是七个村子联合出资\n应该还在可承受的范围内\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.85,0:08:46.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.06,0:08:48.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,还有啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.86,0:08:50.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,如果能请东云先生一起去的话\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.15,0:08:53.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那就能大大节省费用了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.36,0:08:56.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我明白了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.08,0:09:06.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,得在近期去把棘背龙干掉才行啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.96,0:09:10.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天就休息一下\n带莉露去消灭史莱姆好了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.25,0:09:11.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.21,0:09:13.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那个 不好意思\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.30,0:09:16.97,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你是村子的常驻冒险者对吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.18,0:09:20.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那个…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.43,0:09:23.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你有没有看到我的儿子让？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.06,0:09:28.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,让 多纳特 阿莉萨\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.23,0:09:32.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好像没看到这三个孩子的踪影啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.36,0:09:36.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,有冒险者看到\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.15,0:09:39.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,他们三个走在去国见山的路上！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.41,0:09:41.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那帮臭小子\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.95,0:09:43.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,看我不把他们抓回来揍一顿\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.83,0:09:44.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,等等\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.91,0:09:47.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,现在去的话太危险了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.46,0:09:49.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 放开我 你们这帮家伙\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.54,0:09:50.34,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我去吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.17,0:09:54.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,棘背龙的资料 有多少给我多少\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.84,0:09:55.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.84,0:09:56.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我来帮忙\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.05,0:09:58.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不！不用去！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.89,0:10:03.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,驻村的冒险者\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.43,0:10:06.69,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,得为整个村子的利益工作才行…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.23,0:10:09.02,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么能为了那群傻小子\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.10,0:10:11.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,让你去冒险…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.40,0:10:16.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 能拜托你去吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.15,0:10:18.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.20,0:10:21.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.20,0:10:23.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,加油干吧 龙龙！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.37,0:10:26.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那个\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.42,0:10:31.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我听说阿莉萨她们出事了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.42,0:10:36.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 他们在搞什么啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.76,0:10:42.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心 你的朋友很快就会回来的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.97,0:10:47.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我可是白银级冒险者\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.69,0:10:53.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是！拜托你了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.07,0:10:54.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好嘞\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.40,0:10:57.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那么…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.53,0:10:59.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露留下看家\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.08,0:11:10.87,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（29岁单身中坚冒险者的日常）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.30,0:11:17.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好 那我走了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.21,0:11:19.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思啊 驻村冒险者\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.88,0:11:21.72,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我那傻儿子给你添麻烦了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.43,0:11:24.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,只要你能平安把他带回来\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.26,0:11:28.02,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我就亲手打死那个笨蛋\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.31,0:11:30.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.85,0:11:33.31,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.90,0:11:35.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,反正我也没打算战斗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.32,0:11:38.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,只是把那三个人带回来的话…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.45,0:11:49.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,带着莉露酱去真的没问题吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.13,0:11:56.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,说实话\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.46,0:11:59.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,考虑到万一遇上棘背龙的情况\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.84,0:12:01.72,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,当然不能说没问题…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.05,0:12:03.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.80,0:12:06.89,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我又不是你的监护人\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.43,0:12:09.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你自己的小命自己保护！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.93,0:12:11.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我都说了让你看家\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.69,0:12:12.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你还非要跟来\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.10,0:12:14.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要是死了可别怪我\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.31,0:12:17.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,包在我身上\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.23,0:12:21.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好！你明白就好\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.65,0:12:22.49,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,走了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.90,0:12:24.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.61,0:12:25.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,会晃得很厉害\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.41,0:12:27.99,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,张着嘴的话会咬到舌头的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.45,0:12:29.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.74,0:12:31.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我都说了别张嘴！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.96,0:12:33.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要是晕了就早点说\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.46,0:12:35.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要上厕所的时候也要提前说\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.00,0:12:37.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,绝对不许尿裤子！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.79,0:12:38.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,龙龙\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.55,0:12:39.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,知道了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.96,0:12:41.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我都说了别张着嘴了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.01,0:12:43.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,东云先生\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.38,0:12:46.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么看都像个监护人嘛！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.30,0:12:50.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,他们没事吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.44,0:12:55.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那个驻村的冒险者\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.65,0:12:58.27,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,居然被一只魔兽给吓尿了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.57,0:12:59.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真没用\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.69,0:13:01.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是个废物胆小鬼\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.44,0:13:06.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要是把那家伙干掉了\n娜塔莉说不定会夸你哦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.70,0:13:09.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我才不是为了那个！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.66,0:13:11.54,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,事到如今没必要掩饰了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.62,0:13:12.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,烦死了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.25,0:13:14.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是看那家伙\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.91,0:13:16.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不爽而已\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.51,0:13:26.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.39,0:13:30.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这也太大了吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.68,0:13:32.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还是回去比较好吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.48,0:13:35.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,什么啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.48,0:13:37.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你们几个怕了吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.98,0:13:39.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我一点都不怕\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.27,0:13:44.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,自己的村子要自己保护啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.41,0:13:56.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,发生了什么？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.88,0:14:02.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么东西过来了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.22,0:14:13.97,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,难道说…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.72,0:14:18.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是棘背龙吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.35,0:14:20.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,果然很大啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.31,0:14:21.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么办 让?\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.98,0:14:23.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,说什么怎么办…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.03,0:14:25.99,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,只能上了吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.46,0:14:40.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,让\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.85,0:14:52.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,让\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.85,0:14:53.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,没事吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.22,0:14:58.69,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,疼死了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.73,0:15:02.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那就更不能把你留在村子附近了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.09,0:15:25.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,什么…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.81,0:15:37.60,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.35,0:15:41.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,本来还想避免战斗的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.77,0:15:43.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,驻村的…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.61,0:15:44.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你来干什么？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.27,0:15:46.27,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,工作啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.98,0:15:49.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这里交给我 你们回村子去！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.36,0:15:51.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你们父母还在等着呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.91,0:15:54.74,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,快走啊！我们在这碍事\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.50,0:16:01.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,吃我一记莉露之剑！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.13,0:16:06.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 你这小鬼在干什么啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.34,0:16:07.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,很危险的 到这边来\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.00,0:16:10.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的！为什么要妨碍我！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.01,0:16:13.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,放开我啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.18,0:16:15.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,来 你也快走！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.06,0:16:19.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,话说那家伙\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.56,0:16:21.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,打算一个人上吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.64,0:16:23.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,再怎么想也太乱来了吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.13,0:16:54.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,棘背龙的弱点是…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.80,0:16:57.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,把那些刺全部弄掉就好了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.01,0:16:59.72,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始是这么说的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.56,0:17:02.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那些刺是它的弱点吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.68,0:17:04.44,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,听说那些刺没了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.60,0:17:07.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,它的身体就会变软\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.49,0:17:15.32,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,话说那刺有多少根啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.61,0:17:17.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那么多根本不可能全弄掉吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.21,0:17:26.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好痛\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.25,0:17:28.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,没事吧 阿始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.59,0:17:30.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,需要莉露帮忙吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.97,0:17:35.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你头上全是血啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.85,0:17:43.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,去死\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.23,0:17:45.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好惊人的力量\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.14,0:18:23.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,居然是正面单挑\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.91,0:18:49.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好厉害\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.96,0:18:53.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那就是白银级冒险者啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.80,0:19:00.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,一个人…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.68,0:19:01.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就干掉了棘背龙\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.43,0:19:06.31,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 总算搞定了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.81,0:19:08.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然流了不少血\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.02,0:19:11.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不过可以说是多亏流了血才能干掉它\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.56,0:19:14.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.98,0:19:18.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那个驻村的…\n真是个厉害的冒险者啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.03,0:19:21.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,干得好 阿始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.49,0:19:22.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,工作还没结束呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.45,0:19:25.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,得回村子报告讨伐结果\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.91,0:19:27.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,知道了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.29,0:19:30.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,确实\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.96,0:19:33.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,有这家伙在 对村子来说…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.67,0:19:37.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,地震？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.34,0:19:40.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,又来了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.51,0:19:41.89,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,魔兽不是干掉了吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.52,0:19:50.60,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,快闪开 莉露！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.08,0:20:12.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 伤到左手臂了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.38,0:20:15.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,话说 这是什么玩意儿…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.13,0:20:16.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我从没见过这种魔物啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.71,0:20:20.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,冷静下来！别慌！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.51,0:20:21.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,分析情况\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.47,0:20:24.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是逃跑 还是战斗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.22,0:20:27.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不 感觉逃不掉…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.72,0:20:31.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我流了太多血了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.81,0:20:33.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那就战斗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.56,0:20:34.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可是…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.65,0:20:36.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我这个状态扛不住持久战…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.40,0:20:40.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要战斗就得速战速决！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.78,0:20:42.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,正合我意\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.41,0:20:46.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟血也流得够多了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.33,0:20:54.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（始的能力 流血战神）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.59,0:20:59.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,想逃跑？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.93,0:21:12.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.45,0:21:30.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,干掉了…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.21,0:21:36.79,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,总算搞定了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.34,0:21:42.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,没事吧 驻村的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.01,0:21:44.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你的胳膊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.42,0:21:45.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,快回村子吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.18,0:21:48.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,得赶紧治疗才行\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.09,0:21:50.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 烦死了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.43,0:21:51.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,别那么大声\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.56,0:21:54.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,会震到伤口的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.31,0:21:56.44,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 可是…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.64,0:21:57.94,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这种时候谁都会慌的吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.02,0:22:00.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,为了保护莉露\n
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.15,0:22:04.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始的手臂…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.08,0:23:40.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（下一话 战斗结束后）\n
